    {
      "id": "u_cf0d9df952bc3734ae90d7fd_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Icons are useful for distinguishing notes and are displayed near the note title, as well as in various places such as the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__, __TRILIUM_PH_2__Internal (reference) links__TRILIUM_PH_3__ or the __TRILIUM_PH_4__Jump to & command palette__TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "cf0d9df952bc3734ae90d7fdf0c99ef38e5a8d986683d8823a25bdd4bdf4191b",
      "context": "Note Icons & Colors > Icons",
      "contextHash": "832f958ae11a27ffcb17c4ab14b5e23ed53664b403ce51a703241f36e4149e1c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e33b5bb0dd936c6010d2b563_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "While editing a note, click on the icon next to the title to bring up a chooser gallery.",
      "sourceHash": "e33b5bb0dd936c6010d2b5639845c72dfd311cd40684245ed37ca7d84489fda0",
      "context": "Note Icons & Colors > Icons",
      "contextHash": "832f958ae11a27ffcb17c4ab14b5e23ed53664b403ce51a703241f36e4149e1c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bc44dbe7a7fbea480be3e7d4_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Icons can be inherited through the use of __TRILIUM_PH_0__Templates__TRILIUM_PH_1__, or __TRILIUM_PH_2__Attribute Inheritance__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "bc44dbe7a7fbea480be3e7d42140dd3b267af12ec954a09d8d3f5a1a49cf4833",
      "context": "Note Icons & Colors > Icons",
      "contextHash": "832f958ae11a27ffcb17c4ab14b5e23ed53664b403ce51a703241f36e4149e1c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_24158f404ef19a2afcdfa261_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "At the technical level, they are set by the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ attribute which adds a CSS class to the note. For example __TRILIUM_PH_1__ will show a calendar instead of the default page or folder icon. Looking up and remembering the CSS class names is not necessary.",
      "sourceHash": "24158f404ef19a2afcdfa261228b5b5720c69dc6dee9835245b19f3a21e9f28b",
      "context": "Note Icons & Colors > Icons",
      "contextHash": "832f958ae11a27ffcb17c4ab14b5e23ed53664b403ce51a703241f36e4149e1c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_12f43724162c2fcd99ff786e_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Colors__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "12f43724162c2fcd99ff786e8d827a55bb5862125a6581fba862c2b8a3fd41f5",
      "context": "Note Icons & Colors > Colors",
      "contextHash": "7cbd13bcef19769d290bbaf64b3d4664c2b791c2d7a3ab1ba0bb86fe45392a60",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a669ff1779b6701c87c061dc_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Notes can also carry a custom color. Similar to the note icon, this color will be shown in various places such as the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and __TRILIUM_PH_2__Internal (reference) links__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "a669ff1779b6701c87c061dc29e56c5e3e13f5907e5090e3271fe695f716844c",
      "context": "Note Icons & Colors > Colors",
      "contextHash": "7cbd13bcef19769d290bbaf64b3d4664c2b791c2d7a3ab1ba0bb86fe45392a60",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a26081316cca4c4302257c2c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To set a custom color, right click on the note in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and select a predefined color from there or use the color picker (last option).",
      "sourceHash": "a26081316cca4c4302257c2c1de7939c260721791f446348e6f404ae8aafae18",
      "context": "Note Icons & Colors > Colors",
      "contextHash": "7cbd13bcef19769d290bbaf64b3d4664c2b791c2d7a3ab1ba0bb86fe45392a60",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_46d2bc2cd133ec08b2761940_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Alternatively, a custom color can be set manually through the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__label__TRILIUM_PH_2__, whose value must be a valid hex color including the leading __TRILIUM_PH_3__ (e.g. __TRILIUM_PH_4__ for red). This color can be carried over across multiple notes via __TRILIUM_PH_5__Attribute Inheritance__TRILIUM_PH_6__.",
      "sourceHash": "46d2bc2cd133ec08b276194097e3ab921b8cb1f4bf01749d8610734c5551d019",
      "context": "Note Icons & Colors > Colors",
      "contextHash": "7cbd13bcef19769d290bbaf64b3d4664c2b791c2d7a3ab1ba0bb86fe45392a60",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
